"The price of the participation product corresponds to the price range you "
"have defined"
msgstr ""
"Le prix du produit participation correspond à la tranche de prix que vous "
"avez défini"

#: includes/ilist-pot.php:171
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The price of the participation product (%s) does not correspond to the price "
"range (%s) you have defined"
